@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5101

GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipes
Accept: application/json

### Combined cooking-time sorting and cuisine filtering
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipes?sort=desc&cuisine=Indian
Accept: application/json

### Cuisine options from the whole collection
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/cuisines
Accept: application/json

### Recipe detail (404 Problem Details when absent)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipes/tomato-rice
Accept: application/json

### Invalid sort (400 with errors.sort)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipes?sort=invalid
Accept: application/json
